# The compiled programs gcc leaves behind have no file extension (01, 02, ...),
# so instead of listing what to skip, this ignores everything and then allows
# back only the kinds of files worth keeping.

*

# Keep walking into folders, otherwise nothing below is ever seen.
!*/

# Source and site files.
!*.c
!*.h
!*.py
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.json
!*.md
!.gitignore

# Editor settings are not part of the coursework.
.vscode/
